{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-reeb-su2","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Example","doco:Section"],"label":"ex:reeb-su2","kind":"example","title":"Reeb derivation for $\\mathrm{SU}(2)$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-reeb","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-maximal-torus-su2"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-reeb","tags":["su2","reeb"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Examples.su2Reeb","text":"reeb-su2.md","leanSource":"reeb-su2.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"ex:reeb-su2\"></a><p>For <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">G = \\mathrm{SU}(2)</code>, the maximal torus <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T = \\mathrm{U}(1)</code> has the generator <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\xi = \\frac{1}{2}\\begin{smallmatrix} 1 &#x26; 0 \\\\ 0 &#x26; -1 \\end{smallmatrix} \\in \\mathfrak{su}(2)</code>. On <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A = \\mathcal{O}(\\mathrm{SU}(2))</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\xi</code> acts as the left-invariant vector field. The canonical <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code>-form is <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\varTheta_A = \\omega_3</code>, satisfying <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\omega_3(\\xi) = 1</code>. The horizontal forms are those with no <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\omega_3</code> component. In the archimedean realization on a CR manifold <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(M, \\varTheta)</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\xi</code> is the Reeb vector field with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\iota_\\xi d\\varTheta = 0</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/reeb-su2.md","heading":"Example","number":"4.5.4","page":"b/ex-reeb-su2","qa":{"counts":{"pass":66,"fail":0,"warn":1,"na":7,"unknown":0,"stale":48},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Examples.su2Reeb","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/reeb-su2.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
